WEBVTT

00:02:29.230 --> 00:02:33.610
It's insane you paid 1.3 billion
for that worthless stone, oni.

00:02:33.610 --> 00:02:36.880
Actually, we need a jewel
of this caliber to provide

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:40.410
Alma with enough power to fight
against the Dark Stones.

00:02:40.700 --> 00:02:43.870
If you keep doing this,
you'll be bankrupt in no time, oni.

00:02:44.910 --> 00:02:45.870
No matter.

00:02:46.620 --> 00:02:49.420
If that's what it takes to eliminate
the Dark Stones.

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:54.210
If every single Dark Stone is to be eliminated,
then I'm included as well, oni.

00:02:54.210 --> 00:02:56.920
You're too immobile to do
any real mischief.

00:02:56.920 --> 00:03:00.430
You mean I'm not even worth
doing away with?

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:03.350
Well, enough about me, oni.

00:03:03.350 --> 00:03:08.480
But Alma is a Dark Stone. To do away with
them all would be eliminating him as well.

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:13.400
That can't be...

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:30.960
What is this? This feeling.

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:39.970
This is Kagami.
I'm still on the highway.

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:42.800
We should be at the estate
in 20 minutes.

00:03:42.930 --> 00:03:44.390
<i>Yes sir.</i>

00:03:50.060 --> 00:03:52.650
Well, this isn't too showy, is it?

00:03:52.650 --> 00:03:57.020
Nah. I have to hand it to
the Aiba family special escort.

00:03:57.020 --> 00:03:58.480
I thank him.

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:15.750
We're under attack.
Send out the copter.

00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:17.000
<i>Yes sir.</i>

00:04:23.510 --> 00:04:25.010
As I expected.

00:04:25.550 --> 00:04:27.890
Now we can see how well
this thing works.

00:04:33.690 --> 00:04:35.650
It's powerful.

00:04:37.730 --> 00:04:39.730
What is it?

00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:48.330
This can't be.

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:53.710
Kenmi.

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:57.460
You shall die!

00:05:03.760 --> 00:05:04.970
Eat this!

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:27.030
Kenmi!

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:36.120
It's over there.

00:05:38.380 --> 00:05:39.750
I feel it.

00:05:42.420 --> 00:05:43.380
There it is!

00:05:54.730 --> 00:05:56.060
This feeling!

00:05:59.560 --> 00:06:00.730
You...

00:06:01.690 --> 00:06:03.070
You're the same as me.

00:06:39.770 --> 00:06:41.020
Did you finish it?

00:06:41.020 --> 00:06:42.770
<i>No, we lost him.</i>

00:06:46.240 --> 00:06:49.610
But I'm more interested in
this guy's Dark Stone response.

00:07:17.140 --> 00:07:19.020
How are you feeling?

00:07:20.650 --> 00:07:21.770
Where am I?

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:23.730
You're at Miss Ruri's estate.

00:07:24.110 --> 00:07:25.150
Alma!

00:07:25.150 --> 00:07:26.570
Welcome back, Miss Ruri.

00:07:26.570 --> 00:07:28.240
Are you feeling better?

00:07:28.610 --> 00:07:31.030
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:07:31.610 --> 00:07:32.820
I'm glad.

00:07:33.740 --> 00:07:36.660
I can't believe this happened
while I was away.

00:07:36.660 --> 00:07:38.790
No, it's not your fault.

00:07:40.670 --> 00:07:41.830
Miss Ruri.

00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:44.000
Dr. Kenmi is waiting for you.

00:07:46.090 --> 00:07:47.880
It's been a while.

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:50.630
You've grown even more
beautiful, Ruri.

00:07:50.630 --> 00:07:53.890
I'm glad to see you're OK.
I heard you encountered some trouble.

00:07:53.890 --> 00:07:56.310
Kagami's escort helped us.

00:07:57.060 --> 00:08:00.060
I'm honored to hear
we were of some assistance.

00:08:00.940 --> 00:08:04.230
I understand you're here
to ask for a favor?

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:05.270
Ah, yes.

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:08.900
Let me get straight to the point.

00:08:08.990 --> 00:08:14.740
Two subjects have escaped from my lab,
Naito Kijima and Lau Fei Tsui.

00:08:14.910 --> 00:08:19.830
That was Naito Kijima that
attacked us today.

00:08:19.950 --> 00:08:23.710
Kagami told me that he
took the form of a Dark Stone?

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:29.130
Yes, he's using the sacred power
to accomplish his evil goal.

00:08:29.630 --> 00:08:33.130
I was counseling him
at the institution.

00:08:33.130 --> 00:08:37.050
But his outrageous ways
couldn't be helped.

00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:41.890
He's holding a grudge against me
for taking away his freedom.

00:08:42.230 --> 00:08:44.230
Please help us.

00:08:44.310 --> 00:08:47.900
We can capture these two
with your and Alma's help.

00:08:51.990 --> 00:08:54.240
You investigated us,
didn't you?

00:08:54.780 --> 00:08:55.740
Yes.

00:08:56.780 --> 00:09:00.620
You won't use the power
of the Sacred Seven for evil.

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:03.000
That's what we strive to do.

00:09:03.210 --> 00:09:07.080
In that case, please
lend us your powers.

00:09:07.170 --> 00:09:11.380
Naito is taking the drug that will stop him
from turning into a permanent Dark Stone.

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:13.920
But the supply is almost gone.

00:09:14.340 --> 00:09:17.260
He's definitely coming back to get more.

00:09:17.760 --> 00:09:22.100
When that time comes, he'll try
to take my life, just like today.

00:09:22.100 --> 00:09:24.640
Still, I'm hoping to
secure him peacefully.

00:09:24.770 --> 00:09:26.980
It would be for his own good.

00:09:30.270 --> 00:09:31.360
Naito!

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:41.080
Naito! I'm gonna
inject you with it.

00:09:57.800 --> 00:10:00.890
Sorry about that. You OK, Fei?

00:10:01.760 --> 00:10:04.270
I'm OK. I'm more worried
about you though.

00:10:04.270 --> 00:10:06.980
We're almost out
of the drug.

00:10:07.980 --> 00:10:11.320
Yeah, we need to
replenish our stash.

00:10:16.030 --> 00:10:19.320
Hey, how about taking me
with you this time?

00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:22.990
Why?

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:25.830
You went to kill
Kenmi, didn't you?

00:10:26.750 --> 00:10:28.040
You stay here.

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:28.920
Why?

00:10:28.920 --> 00:10:30.000
I can fight too!

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:31.000
Enough!

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:35.090
You're not meant
to go into battle.

00:10:36.840 --> 00:10:39.090
Kenmi won't be easy
to get rid of.

00:10:40.890 --> 00:10:43.970
We also need to have a plan.

00:10:47.730 --> 00:10:51.150
When I fought Kenmi,
I ran into someone unusual.

00:10:52.190 --> 00:10:53.820
That feeling...

00:10:55.110 --> 00:10:59.700
We have the same top-grade power
of the Sacred Seven.

00:11:02.990 --> 00:11:04.490
Naito Kijima?

00:11:04.990 --> 00:11:09.370
...So that means there are others who hold
the power of the Sacred Seven.

00:11:09.370 --> 00:11:13.710
Yes, we've only confirmed a few
throughout the world.

00:11:13.710 --> 00:11:18.510
Apart from you and I, they are
being held at a special agency.

00:11:18.510 --> 00:11:19.970
Special agency?

00:11:20.260 --> 00:11:22.890
The Sacred Seven is
a frightening power.

00:11:22.890 --> 00:11:25.060
It can be an angel
or a devil.

00:11:25.060 --> 00:11:29.480
That's why we need to protect it
from being abused for evil.

00:11:29.890 --> 00:11:31.480
That's what the agency is for.

00:11:32.060 --> 00:11:33.900
Angel or devil?

00:11:37.190 --> 00:11:40.070
I can see what you mean by devil.

00:11:43.370 --> 00:11:45.080
But what about an angel?

00:11:45.830 --> 00:11:46.870
<i>You...</i>

00:11:46.870 --> 00:11:48.250
<i>You're the same as me.</i>

00:11:48.950 --> 00:11:51.370
So what is this power of ours?

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:53.540
At the least...

00:11:55.920 --> 00:11:59.260
...while I'm around,
I won't allow you to become a devil.

00:12:00.260 --> 00:12:04.260
We're heading toward Kenmi's place.
Please get in the car, Alma.

00:12:04.550 --> 00:12:05.760
Gotcha.

00:12:49.310 --> 00:12:54.300
In this facility, we research
how we can use the power

00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:58.650
of the Sacred Seven for
the good of the people.

00:12:59.190 --> 00:13:03.490
There are even some projects that are
ready for practical use. However...

00:13:04.200 --> 00:13:08.620
There are many facets of the power
that have yet to be understood.

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:12.040
If we accidentally misuse its powers,
it could be disastrous.

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:17.710
Anyway, I'm sure you understand
those issues better than we do.

00:13:20.630 --> 00:13:23.670
Well, let's begin our meeting.

00:13:30.640 --> 00:13:33.560
Do you really think
Naito Kijima is coming?

00:13:33.730 --> 00:13:38.400
My calculations show a 95% chance
that he'll make an appearance.

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:44.150
Yes, some time tonight.

00:13:45.030 --> 00:13:47.700
Do you think you'll
be able to capture him?

00:13:48.030 --> 00:13:49.530
It'll be difficult.

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:53.750
You saw first hand
what he's capable of.

00:13:53.750 --> 00:13:57.290
He's becoming even more brutal
as the days pass.

00:13:57.370 --> 00:14:00.750
The incident with Medusa as well as
with the US freight plane...

00:14:00.750 --> 00:14:03.050
...they were all his doing.

00:14:04.300 --> 00:14:06.090
Are you sure?

00:14:06.300 --> 00:14:10.220
Yes, as a Dark Stone
he's unstoppable.

00:14:11.060 --> 00:14:13.750
If he becomes a permanent
Dark Stone, he'll lose all

00:14:13.750 --> 00:14:16.440
reason and won't be able to
return to a human state.

00:14:18.440 --> 00:14:22.230
We must capture the two of them
before this happens.

00:14:22.230 --> 00:14:23.690
You understand the urgency, right?

00:14:24.440 --> 00:14:26.240
Answer this for me.

00:14:27.070 --> 00:14:30.570
Are there any humans who are unable
to revert back from being Dark Stones?

00:14:31.410 --> 00:14:34.080
Answering that would violate
their right to privacy.

00:14:34.080 --> 00:14:36.660
I can't break the
confidentiality agreements.

00:14:37.410 --> 00:14:40.290
But, there is a possibility, Alma.

00:14:40.290 --> 00:14:44.550
You too might become one unable
to recover from being a Dark Stone.

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:49.090
Oh yeah! Then you'll be
just like me, oni!

00:14:49.090 --> 00:14:50.680
I don't want that to happen.

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:55.270
Um, what can we do to help?

00:14:55.640 --> 00:15:00.400
Well, if you could support
the security team.

00:15:00.520 --> 00:15:04.650
I want to help but my suit is
being repaired from yesterday's battle.

00:15:04.780 --> 00:15:06.400
Kagami, you go to the rooftop.

00:15:06.400 --> 00:15:10.410
Ruri and Alma, you'll be
my personal security detail.

00:15:10.700 --> 00:15:15.290
As for the drugs,
my security personnel will handle it.

00:15:20.460 --> 00:15:21.710
Mr. Kagami.

00:15:21.830 --> 00:15:24.290
We've almost completed the repairs.

00:15:24.460 --> 00:15:26.840
Release the output limiter.

00:15:27.130 --> 00:15:28.300
Yes sir.

00:15:29.300 --> 00:15:32.180
I don't think we'll be able to
get him with that, though.

00:15:34.300 --> 00:15:37.640
A little anxious are we?
Already prepping to go, oni?

00:15:37.640 --> 00:15:40.520
We can't be caught off-guard.

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:43.810
Don't put it there!

00:15:43.810 --> 00:15:45.690
I'll want to eat it, oni.

00:15:45.690 --> 00:15:48.440
The calories will do a number
on your tummy.

00:15:50.740 --> 00:15:52.780
What an amusing toy!

00:15:52.780 --> 00:15:54.450
I'm not a toy, oni!

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:57.790
Watch out or I'll rattle you
where the sun don't shine, oni.

00:15:57.790 --> 00:16:00.620
<i>Cool it! Enough of that language, Oni-gawara.</i>

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:04.460
How is it going?
Is there any sign of the Dark Stone?

00:16:05.750 --> 00:16:07.840
<i>No, no, nothing, oni</i>

00:16:08.170 --> 00:16:10.840
OK, well keep your guard up.

00:16:11.300 --> 00:16:12.890
<i>You too, oni.</i>

00:16:16.350 --> 00:16:19.560
Hmph, more trouble.

00:16:19.770 --> 00:16:23.850
More hassle to deal with
but to stay alive I have to get it.

00:16:37.330 --> 00:16:39.870
Whoa! There he is,
here he comes, oni.

00:16:39.870 --> 00:16:40.910
Alma!

00:16:41.710 --> 00:16:43.710
There's no doubt
he's getting closer.

00:16:43.870 --> 00:16:44.960
Let's go.

00:16:48.550 --> 00:16:51.510
Your memories
I take into me.

00:16:55.300 --> 00:16:56.720
My Soul...

00:16:59.560 --> 00:17:00.850
I give to you.

00:17:04.560 --> 00:17:06.860
I'm as ready as I'll ever be.

00:17:11.900 --> 00:17:14.530
I don't have time
to deal with you.

00:17:28.750 --> 00:17:31.420
<i>The Dark Stone is here. Currently engaged in battle.</i>

00:17:51.440 --> 00:17:54.030
<i>The trash is back in the incinerator.</i>

00:17:54.400 --> 00:17:55.820
Activate level five.

00:17:55.820 --> 00:17:56.950
<i>Copy that</i>

00:17:57.950 --> 00:17:58.990
It's him.

00:18:11.710 --> 00:18:13.550
Pollutant creeping in.

00:18:13.550 --> 00:18:15.550
We'll incinerate it to ashes.

00:18:17.470 --> 00:18:18.470
No!

00:18:18.970 --> 00:18:21.050
More heat!

00:18:26.060 --> 00:18:29.310
Can't move about freely
in the water, eh?

00:18:30.610 --> 00:18:33.480
We can serve you
high voltage, too.

00:18:57.050 --> 00:18:59.890
I wonder if I'll get
overtime for this.

00:18:59.970 --> 00:19:01.510
Change form!

00:19:13.320 --> 00:19:14.940
Kenmi's minion?

00:19:26.700 --> 00:19:28.330
Didn't think so...

00:19:29.000 --> 00:19:30.420
Whatever.

00:19:36.710 --> 00:19:37.880
It's gone?

00:19:49.480 --> 00:19:50.440
It's coming.

00:19:50.440 --> 00:19:51.940
It's coming, oni!

00:20:00.450 --> 00:20:03.070
Enough is enough, Kijima.

00:20:05.410 --> 00:20:07.790
There's no way I'm going
to let you live.

00:20:11.960 --> 00:20:13.580
Get out of my way!

00:20:14.420 --> 00:20:15.420
You?

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:19.590
<i>So that is his true form.</i>

00:20:21.760 --> 00:20:23.430
<i>Then this woman...</i>

00:20:23.930 --> 00:20:26.010
<i>She's a Soul Stone, isn't she?</i>

00:20:26.010 --> 00:20:27.510
Naito Kijima.

00:20:27.720 --> 00:20:29.430
Come with us quietly!

00:20:46.580 --> 00:20:47.740
No!

00:20:47.950 --> 00:20:49.950
The power to slip through!

00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:55.830
Wait!

00:20:56.080 --> 00:20:59.460
Are you the one behind
all the Dark Stone incidents?

00:21:00.880 --> 00:21:03.470
Oh, so that's what
you're thinking.

00:21:04.470 --> 00:21:06.760
We're all free to do
as we please.

00:21:06.760 --> 00:21:09.850
This power doesn't belong to anyone.

00:21:09.850 --> 00:21:13.520
You'll be ruined if you lose
your wings of freedom.

00:21:20.980 --> 00:21:23.530
He's better than I thought.

00:21:43.550 --> 00:21:45.680
Hey, cheaters...

00:21:47.510 --> 00:21:49.510
My favorite ear's gone...

00:21:49.680 --> 00:21:51.680
What a bummer.

00:21:53.730 --> 00:21:55.100
No!

00:21:55.480 --> 00:21:56.650
Let go!

00:22:29.550 --> 00:22:31.760
I didn't quite make it this time.

00:22:32.140 --> 00:22:34.220
But now I know
my next step.
